    "detailed_description": "Hi everyone! This is a casual puzzle game that simulates a claw machine.<br>In this game, you can experience a relaxing time. <br>Move the joystick to press the button and collect the plush toys!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/6f266800ceba98c160f73a76b95a5f2f.poster.avif?t=1739938966\" width=480 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/6f266800ceba98c160f73a76b95a5f2f.webm?t=1739938966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/6f266800ceba98c160f73a76b95a5f2f.mp4?t=1739938966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The first 15 are fixed rewards in the level, the remaining need to be obtained through random catch in free mode<br>The acquired dolls can be viewed on the collection shelf. <br>There are a total of 10 levels, with a total of 30 cute dolls of the same style waiting for you to acquire!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/cd10712fe33874adc8782826dc94d155.poster.avif?t=1739938966\" width=480 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/cd10712fe33874adc8782826dc94d155.webm?t=1739938966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/cd10712fe33874adc8782826dc94d155.mp4?t=1739938966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Operation guide/manual<br>Move the grabbing claw by using the buttons or joysticks on the machine.<br>Position and adjust to move the claw to a suitable position so that it can clamp the target object when grabbing it.<br>When the claw is in the ideal position, press the button, and the claw will descend and try to clamp the target object.<br>Once the target object is clamped, the claw will start to rise, bringing the object out of the claw machine to get the doll.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/d0496207c94a938ef4645201f08775f3.poster.avif?t=1739938966\" width=480 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/d0496207c94a938ef4645201f08775f3.webm?t=1739938966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/d0496207c94a938ef4645201f08775f3.mp4?t=1739938966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Game features<br>The game difficulty is casual level, which is suitable for players who do not want to spend too much effort to pass the game.<br>I hope everyone will like this game.<br><br>After clearing customs, you can experience various exquisite character illustrations as a reward.",
